<li id="question-67" class="list-group-item accordion px-0 pt-3 faq-question-item edit-container"
	data-subcategory-id="">
	<div class="position-relative accordion-item shadow-sm">
		<h3 class="accordion-header faq-question-header">
			<button class="accordion-button gap-3 z-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
				data-bs-target="#question-67-answer" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="question-67-answer">
				Who are the members of the City&#x27;s Board of Mayor and Aldermen?
			</button>
		</h3>
		<div id="question-67-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view"><p>Mayor David Parsons,&nbsp;</p><p>Vice Mayor Jack Young,&nbsp;</p><p>Alderman Brad King,&nbsp;</p><p>Alderman Robert Griffin,&nbsp;</p><p>Alderman David Reaves,&nbsp;</p><p>Alderman Monique Williams,&nbsp;</p><p>Alderman Kevin Quinn</p></div>
					<div>
						<a href="http://www.cityofbartlett.org/DocumentCenter/Home/View/45" target=&#x27;_blank&#x27;>Contact Information</a>
					</div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">City Government</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</li>
                


<li id="question-70" class="list-group-item accordion px-0 pt-3 faq-question-item edit-container"
	data-subcategory-id="">
	<div class="position-relative accordion-item shadow-sm">
		<h3 class="accordion-header faq-question-header">
			<button class="accordion-button gap-3 z-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
				data-bs-target="#question-70-answer" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="question-70-answer">
				Which Alderman represents my district?
			</button>
		</h3>
		<div id="question-70-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view">All Bartlett Aldermen serve at large.  They all represent all of Bartlett.</div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">City Government</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</li>
                


<li id="question-76" class="list-group-item accordion px-0 pt-3 faq-question-item edit-container"
	data-subcategory-id="">
	<div class="position-relative accordion-item shadow-sm">
		<h3 class="accordion-header faq-question-header">
			<button class="accordion-button gap-3 z-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
				data-bs-target="#question-76-answer" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="question-76-answer">
				When and where do the Board of Mayor and Aldermen meet?
			</button>
		</h3>
		<div id="question-76-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view"><p>The Bartlett Board of Mayor &amp; Aldermen meets on the 2nd and 4th Tuesday of each month at Bartlett City Hall, 6400 Stage Road at 6:00 pm. Board agendas are posted on the bulletin board outside of City Hall and also on the web page at www.cityofbartlett.org no more than three days before the meeting.</p></div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">City Government</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</li>
                


<li id="question-78" class="list-group-item accordion px-0 pt-3 faq-question-item edit-container"
	data-subcategory-id="">
	<div class="position-relative accordion-item shadow-sm">
		<h3 class="accordion-header faq-question-header">
			<button class="accordion-button gap-3 z-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
				data-bs-target="#question-78-answer" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="question-78-answer">
				How do I get an item placed on the agenda for the Board of Mayor and Aldermen?
			</button>
		</h3>
		<div id="question-78-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view">Citizens may speak on any topic for up to three minutes during Open Discussion at the end of every Board of Mayor and Aldermen meeting. </div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">City Government</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</li>
                


<li id="question-301" class="list-group-item accordion px-0 pt-3 faq-question-item edit-container"
	data-subcategory-id="">
	<div class="position-relative accordion-item shadow-sm">
		<h3 class="accordion-header faq-question-header">
			<button class="accordion-button gap-3 z-0" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
				data-bs-target="#question-301-answer" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="question-301-answer">
				How do I volunteer to serve on a city-appointed board or commission?
			</button>
		</h3>
		<div id="question-301-answer" class="accordion-collapse collapse show">
			<div class="accordion-body">
				<div class="accordion-text redesign-text fr-view"><p>To volunteer, you must be a resident of Bartlett. Please send a letter to Mayor Parsons stating the board or commission you are interested in, a little bit about yourself and your background/qualifications, and list all contact information (home address, home phone, work phone, fax number, cell phone, e-mail address). The letter can be mailed to Mayor David Parsons, 6400 Stage Rd., Bartlett, TN 38134 or e-mailed to him at dparsons@cityofbartlett.org</p></div>
					<div>
						<a href="http://www.cityofbartlett.org/DocumentView.asp?DID=46" target=&#x27;_blank&#x27;>List of Boards and Commissions</a>
					</div>
				<span class="badge text-body category-pill rounded-pill mw-100 text-truncate">City Government</span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="col-md-4 d-none d-md-block">
                    
